    <h2>MariaDB Connector/Java 3.5.11</h2>
    <h2><a
    href="https://github.com/mariadb-corporation/mariadb-connector-j/tree/3.5.11">3.5.11</a>
    (Oct 2026)</h2>
    <p><a
    href="https://github.com/mariadb-corporation/mariadb-connector-j/compare/3.5.10...3.5.11">Full
    Changelog</a></p>
    <h4>Key Enhancements</h4>
    <ul>
    <li>CONJ-1386 - New sslMode=allow: verify-full when the server announces
    TLS, unencrypted otherwise, for a mix of
    servers with and without TLS behind one connection string</li>
    <li>CONJ-1353 - Generate a CycloneDX 1.6 SBOM meeting the CISA 2026
    minimum elements</li>
    <li>CONJ-1356 - parsec authentication without BouncyCastle on Java 8/11
    and without provider-dependent key derivation</li>
    <li>CONJ-1355 - Add NonRegisteringDriver so that DataSources and pools
    never register the driver in DriverManager, which pinned the class
    loader (report by mario-schwede-hivemq)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1348 - Reassembling packets larger than 16 MB copied the
    accumulated content once per fragment</li>
    </ul>
    <h4>Issues Resolved</h4>
    <ul>
    <li>CONJ-1383 - Connection init rebuilds session_track_system_variables
    from @<a href="https://github.com/global"><code>@​global</code></a>,
    discarding the session-level
    last_gtid set by MaxScale (report by Sawan Patel)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1379 - Set an explicit session tracking list and guard
    character_set_results like character_set_client
    (report by fg0x0)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1381 - Bound server-declared lengths by the packet before
    allocating and reading from them (report by fg0x0)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1357 - XA recover() must not trust server-supplied
    gtrid_length/bqual_length (report by fg0x0)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1374 - Redirect URL password partially logged when containing
    '@' (report by <a
    href="https://github.com/manus-pi"><code>@​manus-pi</code></a>)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1372 - caching_sha2_password full authentication fails over a
    Unix socket when SSL is disabled (report by 工藤航)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1360 - Incorrect dependency check in AwsIamCredentialPlugin
    (report by Dheeraj Nalluri)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1358 - Client-side query timeout thread cannot be stopped and
    outlives an idle driver</li>
    <li>CONJ-1352 - Batched statements fail when a trigger produces a result
    set (report by Christopher Schultz)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1351 - Reading an invalid DATE value might throw unchecked
    exceptions instead of SQLException</li>
    <li>CONJ-1346 - Log-and-throw antipattern: server errors and hostname
    verification failures logged at DEBUG instead of
    WARN/INFO (report by Alexander Schwartz)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1345 - DatabaseMetaData#getURL() exposes database password
    since Connector/J 3.5.10 (report by Klaas)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1344 - DatabaseMetaData imported/exported keys ignore
    lower_case_table_names when using SHOW CREATE TABLE
    (report by plantegg ren)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1343 - DatabaseMetaData.getSQLKeywords() includes eight pairs
    of concatenated words (report by Adam Rauch)</li>
    <li>CONJ-1349 - DatabaseMetaData.getBestRowIdentifier() returns primary
    key columns in an undefined order</li>
    </ul>
    </blockquote>
